  "bodyHash": "QE32NtVPCx0=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">變異怪物將Minecraft的生物提升到令人畏懼的新高度！與經典生物的變異版本戰鬥，每種都擁有毀滅性的力量和獨特的獎勵。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">擊敗變異殭屍、骷髏、苦力怕、終界使者等，每個都帶來全新的挑戰。製作強大的物品、馴服爆炸性的僕從，並發現像蜘蛛豬這樣奇異的新生物。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">準備好迎接史詩般的戰鬥和傳奇戰利品，在這個生存不保証的世界中奮戰！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💥 特色變異生物</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧟‍♂️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">變異殭屍</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一個擁有強大猛擊攻擊的龐大蠻力。擊敗它可獲得強大的</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">浩克破壞者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">變異骷髏</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一個致命的神射手。擊敗它可用其骨頭製作</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">變異骷髏盔甲</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">變異苦力怕</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：以連鎖爆炸造成混亂。死亡時掉落</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">苦力怕僕從蛋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">變異終界使者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一個會傳送的恐怖存在。砍下它的手以獲得</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">終界靈魂之手</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">的力量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">☃️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">變異雪人</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一個強大的盟友，會向敵人投擲巨大的冰塊。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">👾 僕從與夥伴</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">苦力怕僕從</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：從</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">苦力怕僕從蛋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">孵化出的爆炸性盟友。使用</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">苦力怕僕從追蹤器</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可馴服並追蹤它們。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🕷️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">蜘蛛豬</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一種快速且難以預測的生物，透過對吃了發酵蜘蛛眼的豬使用</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">化學X</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">創造而成。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧪 特殊物品</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛠️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">化學X</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一種神秘液體，能將生物變異成強大的變異體或奇怪的新生物。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">浩克破壞者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一把強大的武器，能猛擊地面，擊退敵人。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧤 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">終界靈魂之手</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：從變異終界使者獲得傳送和方塊操控的力量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">苦力怕碎片</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一種有毒武器，對地形使用時會引發爆炸。透過破壞</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">苦力怕僕從蛋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">獲得。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧬 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">苦力怕僕從追蹤器</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一種用於追蹤和控制苦力怕僕從的裝置。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">變異骷髏盔甲</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：用</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">變異骷髏骨頭</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">製作出的強大盔甲。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端與伺服器端皆需安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric &amp; NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模組支援，可以直接在遊戲中使用模組選單進行設定（Fabric 需要安裝</span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，原作者為</span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）。請注意，在舊版 Minecraft 中，也需要安裝</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若要使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有檔案均位於</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，並根據設定類型命名為</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">或</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。並非所有類型都可能存在於某個模組中，甚至可能完全沒有設定檔。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">衷心感謝</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shcott21\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Shcott21</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，他在多年前以</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-creatures-mod\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mutant Creatures</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">的名義最初發布了這個模組。大部分的工作，尤其是那些令人驚嘆的模型，都是由他完成的。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/chumbanotz\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Chumbanotz</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，他是第一個以</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-beasts\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mutant Beasts</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">模組的形式將變異生物帶入現代Minecraft的人，為這次最終復興奠定了基礎。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">非常感謝</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tdstress\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">tdstress</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，他徹底翻新了模組中的所有紋理，以符合新的Minecraft美術風格！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/echo-chest\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/echochest/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/effect-descriptions\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectdescriptions/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/dyed-flames\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/dyedflames/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
